id: SECRETS-059
title: LaunchDarkly SDK Key
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
patterns:
  - regex: sdk-[a-f0-9]{8}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{4}-[a-f0-9]{12}
    message: LaunchDarkly SDK key detected. This allows reading feature flag configurations for your environment.
fix: Rotate the key at LaunchDarkly > Account Settings > Projects. Use client-side IDs for frontend and SDK keys only server-side.
